KaTeX 0.19.1 (https://katex.org), unmodified, from the npm package:
dist/katex.min.js, dist/katex.min.css and the woff2 fonts.

katex.min.js and katex.min.css: MIT License (LICENSE).
fonts/*.woff2: SIL Open Font License 1.1 (fonts/OFL.txt), as each font's
own metadata states; the fonts are not modified.

export/html.py inlines all of it into every exported page, with both
notices in a comment at the top of the page.
